1
00:00:04,750 --> 00:00:07,550
Open any Markdown file and press Open Preview.

2
00:00:07,750 --> 00:00:11,650
Front matter, prose and layout, drawn as a styled page.

3
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:15,400
Click a paragraph and edit it right where you read.

4
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:17,400
Select a word, press Cmd+B to make it bold.

5
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:19,600
Done. The page updates in place.

6
00:00:20,279 --> 00:00:23,379
Type / on a new line to open the command menu.

7
00:00:23,479 --> 00:00:26,832
Pick a MyST admonition, a table, math and more.

8
00:00:26,909 --> 00:00:28,063
Everything stays plain Markdown.

9
00:00:28,690 --> 00:00:33,790
MyST tabs switch panels with a click.

10
00:00:34,090 --> 00:00:36,990
Cards, admonitions and dropdowns render natively.

11
00:00:36,940 --> 00:00:39,740
Vega-Lite charts render right in the page.

12
00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:43,940
So do Mermaid diagrams, and both stay editable as text.

13
00:00:44,490 --> 00:00:46,790
Review threads attach to a sentence.

14
00:00:46,890 --> 00:00:50,690
A change bar marks what you edited since the last commit.

15
00:00:51,090 --> 00:00:54,590
A table of contents is one click away.

16
00:00:56,115 --> 00:00:59,215
Switch the page theme: Cream, White or Dark.
